author=Doubao
description=Rooted-device embedded MCP server: watchdog-supervised 24/7 daemon (survives KSU Manager lifecycle, auto-restart on crash), Streamable HTTP (/mcp) + legacy SSE on port 9123, LAN access, built-in tunnel client with WS keepalive & network-switch auto-reconnect, modern animated WebUI control panel.